  <data key="d3">STUDIED_AT</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Charles_and_Ray_Eames.md</data>
  <data key="d5">Charles Eames secured an architecture scholarship at Washington University, but his devotion to the practices of Frank Lloyd Wright caused issues with his tutors and he left after two years of study.</data>
