  <data key="d4">en_Bauhaus.md</data>
  <data key="d5">In 1953, Max Bill, together with Inge Aicher-Scholl and Otl Aicher, founded the Ulm School of Design (German: Hochschule für Gestaltung – HfG Ulm) in Ulm, Germany, a design school in the tradition of the Bauhaus.</data>
</edge>
