  <data key="d3">TAUGHT_AT</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Dieter_Rams.md</data>
  <data key="d5">After he joined the company, he became a protégé of Fritz Eichler and the Ulm School of Design professors Hans Gugelot and Otl Aicher, all of whom worked for Braun in various capacities.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Person:max bill" target="Institution:ulm school of design" id="FOUNDED|10">
  <data key="d3">FOUNDED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Ulm_School_of_Design.md</data>
  <data key="d5">It was founded in 1953 by Inge Aicher-Scholl, Otl Aicher and Max Bill, the latter being first rector of the school and a former student at the Bauhaus.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Person:max bill" target="Institution:ulm school of design" id="TAUGHT_AT|12">
  <data key="d3">TAUGHT_AT</data>
