  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Art_Nouveau.md</data>
  <data key="d5">These geometric forms were used with particular effect in the architecture and furniture of Joseph Maria Olbrich, Otto Wagner, Koloman Moser and Josef Hoffmann, especially the Stoclet Palace in Brussels, which announced the arrival of Art Deco and modernism.</data>
</edge>
