<edge source="Person:ramón casas" target="Person:antoni gaudí" id="INFLUENCED_BY|236">
  <data key="d3">INFLUENCED_BY</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Art_Nouveau.md</data>
  <data key="d5">The Catalan modernist painters (Ramón Casas, Santiago Rusiñol, Aleix Clapés, Joaquim Sunyer, Hermenegildo Anglada Camarasa, Juan Brull, Ricard Canals, Javier Gosé, Josep Maria Sert, Miguel Utrillo, etc.), closely connected with the avant-garde in Paris, and hugely influenced by Antoni Gaudí, had in the Els Quatre Gats tavern their meeting place.</data>
</edge>
