  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Philip_Johnson.md</data>
  <data key="d5">After completing the Glass House, he completed two more houses in New Canaan in a style similar to the Glass House; the Hodgson House (1951) and the Wiley House (1953).</data>
</edge>
