  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Philip_Johnson.md</data>
  <data key="d5">In 1954–56, he made the pro bono design for Congregation Kneses Tifereth Israel, a synagogue for a conservative Jewish congregation in Port Chester, New York.</data>
