  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Philip_Johnson.md</data>
  <data key="d5">The TC Energy Center (formerly Republic Bank Center, later, Bank of America Center), in Houston (1983), was the first postmodern skyscraper in the Houston skyline.</data>
</edge>
