  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Philip_Johnson.md</data>
  <data key="d5">In 1986, Johnson and Burgee moved their offices into one of their new buildings, the elliptical Lipstick Building at 885 Third Avenue in New York, nicknamed because of its resemblance to the color and shape of a stick of lipstick.</data>
</edge>
