<edge source="Person:louis kahn" target="Work:jatiyo sangshad bhaban" id="DESIGNED|921">
  <data key="d3">DESIGNED</data>
  <data key="d4">en_Modern_architecture.md</data>
  <data key="d5">Following the example of Le Corbusier and his design of the government buildings in Chandigarh, the capital city of the Haryana &amp; Punjab State of India, Kahn designed the Jatiyo Sangshad Bhaban (National Assembly Building) in Dhaka, Bangladesh (1962–74), when that country won independence from Pakistan.</data>
