  <data key="d4">en_Modern_architecture.md</data>
  <data key="d5">Between 1963 and 1967 Pei designed the Mesa Laboratory for the National Center for Atmospheric Research outside Boulder, Colorado, in an open area at the foothills of the Rocky Mountains.</data>
